@host = http://localhost:8080

### Health
GET {{host}}/actuator/health

### Submit job
POST {{host}}/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{"type":"sum","payload":{"numbers":[10,20,30]},"priority":5,"maxRetries":3,"timeoutSeconds":10}

### Retry demo; fails twice, succeeds third attempt
POST {{host}}/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{"type":"flaky","payload":{"failUntilAttempt":2},"maxRetries":3,"timeoutSeconds":10}

### Timeout demo
POST {{host}}/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{"type":"sleep","payload":{"millis":10000},"maxRetries":1,"timeoutSeconds":1}

### Delayed (use a future ISO-8601 instant)
POST {{host}}/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{"type":"sum","payload":{"numbers":[1,2]},"runAt":"2030-01-01T10:00:00Z"}

### Recurring every minute (six-field Spring cron)
POST {{host}}/schedules
Content-Type: application/json

{"type":"sum","payload":{"numbers":[3,4]},"cronExpression":"0 * * * * *","timezone":"Asia/Kolkata","maxRetries":2,"timeoutSeconds":30}

### Queue depth
GET {{host}}/queue/depth

### Stop new claims
POST {{host}}/queue/drain

### Resume claims
POST {{host}}/queue/resume

### Metrics
GET {{host}}/actuator/prometheus
